	(text "BLE R1401 is the optional Lm2 position populated as 0R for Rev-A baseline; C1402 is on ANT/Lm1 input, C1403 at Lm1/Lm2 junction, C1404 DNP at Lm2 output."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 192.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.64 0.64)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "918ef42a-d323-4f05-a34c-b2280b3b9f33")
	)
	(text "Wi-Fi and GNSS use DNP/0R/DNP pi footprints so the antenna feed can be tuned without a PCB respin. Exact capacitor/series element values are selected after antenna and enclosure freeze."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 199.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.64 0.64)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a74ef637-78ef-4ff5-acfc-022fca780141")
	)
	(text "Wi-Fi: 06_WIFI already combines nRF7002 TXRF0/TXRF1 through the Nordic 2.4/5GHz diplexer. 14_RF therefore starts from the single WIFI_RF feed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 196.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.64 0.64)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a84920c9-dbb4-4e03-913a-8ce235b8bdf7")
	)
	(text "Exact antenna MPNs/footprints are intentionally frozen only after case + PCB outline + battery + display geometry are known."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.85 0.85)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b4626605-69c3-48f9-a23d-7b4a45d44564")
	)
	(text "BLE: N1 BLE_ANT is single-ended RF; M1 BLE_AVDD_PA feeds the PA bias network. L1401/C1401 and the matching chain follow Ambiq's published initial BLE topology."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 186 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.64 0.64)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b64ab763-9d03-4b79-86c6-f1702347e053")
	)
	(text "MAX-F10S GNSS L1/L5 — passive dual-band antenna baseline"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 141 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cedd39eb-6f07-46c8-ac79-fc947a3d1992")
	)
	(text "Keep GNSS especially far from display clocks, Wi-Fi, switching regulators and haptic currents. Final antenna placements/keepouts are mechanical + RF decisions, not schematic-only decisions."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 196.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.64 0.64)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "def5b963-9243-4267-98dd-8304097c4070")
	)
